{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n 先日の握手会で\n \n かぼちゃになってた\n さりなちゃんを\n よしよししていたら\n \n 石森さんも\n 可愛がってくれました\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZ6ZE4N3PT8XWPT0229GA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZ7XXCM0ATV9M567ZFWHK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZ8WQ1VGQP973E4S3PHRF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 可愛い可愛い私たちの赤ちゃん\n \n \n 石森さん\n 優しくしてくれて\n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZ9Y0NVVC09T0C0G1AFW1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZAXDC7ZGPF8SMN0S74A7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZBTYRPZT003308J0JKGV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZCTRKW0J822S5M3KFP67","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZDSMBKTRVSX98A1P4JBJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 最近\n この2人が癒しです \n \n 2人とも違ったタイプのお花畑ちゃんで\n それがめちゃくちゃ面白くて好きなんです💓\n \n 私も少し\n お花畑なとこがあるので\n なんか楽しいです〜\n \n 3人の会話は\n 本当に内容の無い\n お花畑話です\n \n それがまた\n 本当に無意味すぎて楽しい（笑）\n \n それでいて\n この2人は礼儀正しくて\n ちゃんとしてるので\n 私は安心して身を任せられます\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZESB4WHS58EW01BZEK0S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZFS4G517EY9YSWGA86C5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZH0ZB7G7204M9Z1TBQ5Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n さりなちゃん子育て会\n また早くやりたいねᕦ(ò_óˇ)ᕤ\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFZHZ6H16A0RQFNJ2Z6M5P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n さりなちゃん👶🎃\n \n いつもダンス教えてくれてありがとう💓\n \n \n \n \n p.s.\n そういえば気球に乗りにいくのは諦めて、3人のハワイ貯金に切り替えたらしいです。多分。\n また早く遊ばなきゃ！あーあの日は面白かった😝😝毎日楽しいことをして過ごしたい！"}],"source":"archive"}